{"overview":"لیوتی یگامی، دانش‌آموز برتر با چشم‌اندازهای بزرگ—و او از خستگی بی‌نهایت خسته است. اما همه چیز تغییر می‌کند وقتی که او دفترچه‌ی Death Note را پیدا می‌کند، دفترچه‌ای که توسط یک شینیگامی (خداوند مرگ) گمشده رها شده است. هر انسانی که نامش در دفترچه نوشته شود، می‌میرد، و لیوتی قول داده است از قدرت Death Note برای پاک‌سازی جهان از شر استفاده کند. اما آیا لیوتی در رسیدن به هدف نیکو‌خوب خود موفق خواهد شد، یا Death Note او را به همان چیزی که می‌جنگد تبدیل خواهد کرد؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"Light Yagami is an ace student with great prospects—and he’s bored out of his mind. But all that changes when he finds the Death Note, a notebook dropped by a rogue Shinigami death god. Any human whose name is written in the notebook dies, and Light has vowed to use the power of the Death Note to rid the world of evil. But will Light succeed in his noble goal, or will the Death Note turn him into the very thing he fights against?","tagline_en":"The human whose name is written in this note shall die.","runtime":22,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":37,"y":2006,"poster":"/chnG4pYo89weaBjXHJWvW68E35B.jpg"}],"episodes":37,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"مامورو میانو","role":"Light Yagami (voice)","photo":"/nuok8ueG7k9hPZ09Tpr8e7Qn0ah.jpg","en":"Mamoru Miyano"},{"name":"山口勝平","role":"L (voice)","photo":"/mJyxKRZxLv9D7LH5KcNSkjSKYOB.jpg","en":"Kappei Yamaguchi"},{"name":"中村獅童","role":"Ryuk (voice)","photo":"/dMyf8ZoHD5xkld66h8bEw9QgQZI.jpg","en":"Shido Nakamura"},{"name":"آیا هیرانو","role":"Misa Amane (voice)","photo":"/AvbCkdSXoKgrQAyG08b4WdGKoX5.jpg","en":"Aya Hirano"},{"name":"日髙のり子","role":"Near (voice)","photo":"/43OuwsjqGf7JxpFpUvB75OdDDXQ.jpg","en":"Noriko Hidaka"},{"name":"佐々木望","role":"Mello (voice)","photo":"/7usoPlvc9Xa1rDA2vxmVi0OvLDb.jpg","en":"Nozomu Sasaki"},{"name":"斉藤貴美子","role":"Rem (voice)","photo":"/rPP0jCjtLuEEroY3e2aRT8zonYK.jpg","en":"Kimiko Saito"},{"name":"内田直哉","role":"Soichiro Yagami (voice)","photo":"/i1